"P3191199960" "The Nexus of Thorns"
// DetailString :
"P3665924585" "The demoness Trepsarceil was willing to share her secret knowledge as part of her revenge against the Circle of Thorns. The first thing she wanted you to do was prove your ability by defeating members of the Circle. You handled this, and returned to the fiend."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
